ord on a  motive yet either but we know detectives  are currently  interviewing moreno rodriguez back to  you  vanessa thanks for that so let's remind  our viewers of the timeline of events  that have happened here in the last two  weeks  police say that liam and his mother left  san jose on the 24th  then on the 26th they can be placed in  the laguna beach area  and then later that same day in  victorville police telling us that she  stayed in a las vegas hotel on the 27th  but then liam's body was discovered the  next day in mountain springs  then on the 29th marina rodriguez's car  was seen traveling on i-70 near grand  junction  then fast forward to the 31st she  checked herself into a denver area hotel  and that's where we find deborah  takahara live tonight with more on the  arrest deborah  we're at the denver detention center  where samantha moreno rodriguez will be  held until she is taken to las vegas to  face charges  of murder investigators were able to  take her into custody this morning  just before six o'clock this morning  they say she was taken into custody  without  incident and they say they are relieved  she was found and taken into custody  so quickly after releasing that picture  to the media yesterday  still unclear about how investigators  tracked her to that motel  but they say they are here trying to  interview her and they'll get more  information in the days and weeks to  come  live in denver deborah takahara back to  you deborah metro police just talking  about how relieved they are too that she  is now in custody  any idea of how long it might take for  her to come back to las vegas  well they say if she agrees to waive  extradition she could be back in vegas  by the end of this week  but they say if she decides to fight  extradition it could take up to 30 days  now deborah there were several days  there that we really haven't quite  figured out where she was  but today when she was finally taken  into custody was she alone was there  anybody with her  we do understand from investigators they  tell us she was with an unidentified man  they won't tell us much about him  although they do say they do not believe  they are confident he was not involved  in liam's death  or any way involved in this case deborah  takahara reporting live tonight in  denver thanks for that
 

